# Whitelist .gitignore: ignore everything by default, explicitly allow only the files
# that belong in the repo. When you add a new file type, add it to the allowlist below.

# ─── Step 1: ignore everything ────────────────────────────────────────────────
*

# ─── Step 2: allow git to descend into directories ────────────────────────────
# Without these, git won't look inside subdirectories at all, and the allowlist
# below can never match nested files.
!*/
!.github/

# ─── Step 3: allowlist (essential file types and specific filenames) ──────────

# Repo metadata
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.editorconfig

# Project / build configuration
!*.toml
!*.lock

# Documentation and license
!*.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE.*

# Source
!*.rs

# Web assets — hand-written stylesheet (vendored JS is fetched, not committed)
!*.css

# Future: gRPC proto sources
!*.proto

# Future: sqlx migrations
!*.sql

# Future: CI workflows
!*.yml
!*.yaml

# Future: WiX MSI installer sources
!*.wxs
!*.wxi
!*.wxl

# Future: static assets shipped with the repo (logos, diagrams)
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.svg
!*.webp

# C# / WinUI shell (Windows) — source + project files
!*.cs
!*.xaml
!*.csproj
!*.sln
!*.slnx
!*.props
!*.targets
!*.config
!*.json
!*.manifest
!*.appxmanifest
!*.pubxml
!*.resw
!*.resx
!*.ico
!*.xml

# Future: SwiftUI (macOS/iOS) + Kotlin (Android) shells — allowlist their source +
# project files when those land (e.g. *.swift, *.plist, *.pbxproj, *.entitlements,
# *.kt, *.kts, *.gradle, *.pro, plus the specific binaries gradlew /
# gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar / gradle-wrapper.properties).

# ─── Step 4: re-ignore noise that the allowlist would otherwise let through ───
# These run last so they override anything matched above.

# Rust build artifacts
target/
*.pdb
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# .NET / Visual Studio / WinUI build output. `!*/` descends into these dirs and the
# allowlist above would otherwise track generated .cs/.json/.png inside them, so
# re-ignore the whole dirs (files under an ignored dir can't be re-included).
bin/
obj/
.vs/
Generated Files/
AppPackages/
BundleArtifacts/
*.user

# Generated uniffi bindings — reproduced by `cargo run --bin gen-bindings` from
# sylva-sdk, so not committed. Explicit path beats the `!*.cs` allowlist above;
# the .dll + future swift/kotlin output fall to the base `*` ignore on their own.
bindings/csharp/sylva_sdk.cs

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local config / secrets (overrides !*.toml for the *.local.toml case)
.env
.env.*
*.local.toml
/secrets/

# Runtime artifacts (future checkpoints)
/data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
